{"result":{"acceptance_year":null,"advert_code":"F36208","advert_description":"P\u0159edstavujeme v\u00e1m jedine\u010dn\u00fd mezonetov\u00fd apartm\u00e1n o dispozici 3+kk, kter\u00fd spojuje v\u00fdhody prostorn\u00e9ho bytu a soukrom\u00ed rodinn\u00e9ho domu. Nach\u00e1z\u00ed se v presti\u017en\u00edm reziden\u010dn\u00edm komplexu Oliu v malebn\u00e9m historick\u00e9m m\u011bste\u010dku Capdepera na severov\u00fdchod\u011b Mallorky.\r\n\r\nTento duplex nab\u00edz\u00ed dv\u011b \u00farovn\u011b modern\u00edho a vzdu\u0161n\u00e9ho bydlen\u00ed o celkov\u00e9 plo\u0161e 101,1 m\u00b2. Sou\u010d\u00e1st\u00ed jednotky jsou t\u0159i prostorn\u00e9 lo\u017enice, t\u0159i elegantn\u00ed koupelny a sv\u011btl\u00fd ob\u00fdvac\u00ed pokoj spojen\u00fd s kuchyn\u00ed v otev\u0159en\u00e9m stylu. K apartm\u00e1nu n\u00e1le\u017e\u00ed dv\u011b terasy \u2013 jedna hlavn\u00ed terasa ide\u00e1ln\u00ed pro odpo\u010dinek a stolov\u00e1n\u00ed, druh\u00e1 soukrom\u00e1 terasa se nach\u00e1z\u00ed na st\u0159e\u0161e a poskytuje exkluzivn\u00ed prostor pro relaxaci pod \u0161ir\u00fdm nebem \u2013 perfektn\u00ed pro rann\u00ed k\u00e1vu s v\u00fdhledem na okoln\u00ed p\u0159\u00edrodu nebo ve\u010dern\u00ed sklenku v\u00edna.\r\n\r\nVybaven\u00ed duplexu:\r\n-Pln\u011b vybaven\u00e1 kuchyn\u011b se spot\u0159ebi\u010di Siemens (nebo srovnatelnou zna\u010dkou)\r\n-2 designov\u00e9 koupelny s n\u00e1bytkem Kyrya a armaturami Tres\r\n-Keramick\u00e1 dla\u017eba Saloni ve velk\u00e9m form\u00e1tu (v\u010detn\u011b protiskluzov\u00e9 varianty na teras\u00e1ch)\r\n\r\nSou\u010d\u00e1st\u00ed bytu je i parkovac\u00ed m\u00edsto v podzemn\u00ed gar\u00e1\u017ei.\r\nTato nemovitost je ur\u010dena pro ty, kte\u0159\u00ed ocen\u00ed nadstandardn\u00ed komfort, d\u016fmysln\u00e9 uspo\u0159\u00e1d\u00e1n\u00ed a st\u0159edomo\u0159skou atmosf\u00e9ru s n\u00e1dechem luxusu.\r\n\r\nSpole\u010dn\u00e9 vybaven\u00ed komplexu:\r\n- Venkovn\u00ed baz\u00e9n\r\n- St\u0159edomo\u0159sk\u00e1 zahrada s relaxa\u010dn\u00edmi z\u00f3nami\r\n- Podzemn\u00ed gar\u00e1\u017ee\r\n\r\nCapdepera je autentick\u00e9 m\u011bste\u010dko s bohatou histori\u00ed, st\u0159edov\u011bk\u00fdm hradem a typickou mallorskou atmosf\u00e9rou. V doch\u00e1zkov\u00e9 vzd\u00e1lenosti najdete restaurace, kav\u00e1rny i trhy s m\u00edstn\u00edmi produkty. Kr\u00e1sn\u00e9 pl\u00e1\u017ee jako Son Moll, Cala Agulla nebo Cala Mesquida jsou vzd\u00e1leny jen p\u00e1r minut j\u00edzdy.\r\n\r\nPl\u00e1\u017e: cca 1,8 km\r\nLeti\u0161t\u011b Palma de Mallorca: cca 76 km\r\nGolfov\u00e9 h\u0159i\u0161t\u011b Capdepera: 5 minut j\u00edzdy\r\n\r\nPl\u00e1novan\u00e9 dokon\u010den\u00ed v\u00fdstavby: \u010derven a p\u0159edan\u00ed nemovitosti listopad 2027\r\n\r\nTento duplex je ide\u00e1ln\u00ed volbou pro n\u00e1ro\u010dn\u00e9 klienty, kte\u0159\u00ed hledaj\u00ed kombinaci pohodl\u00ed, stylu, prakti\u010dnosti a v\u00fdborn\u00e9 investice. A\u0165 u\u017e jako letn\u00ed s\u00eddlo, trval\u00fd domov, nebo nemovitost k pron\u00e1jmu \u2013 tento projekt spl\u0148uje v\u0161e, co od st\u0159edomo\u0159sk\u00e9ho bydlen\u00ed o\u010dek\u00e1v\u00e1te.\r\n\r\nKontaktujte n\u00e1s pro v\u00edce informac\u00ed, aktu\u00e1ln\u00ed ceny, dostupn\u00e9 jednotky a p\u016fdorysy. R\u00e1di v\u00e1m pom\u016f\u017eeme vybrat to prav\u00e9.","advert_images":[{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":740,"id":1017353948,"kind":2,"order":1,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/nCXhmtHPUD8nezOkdIKNa0r/2249.jpeg","width":1760},{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":740,"id":1017353951,"kind":2,"order":5,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/nCXhmtHPUBiA4qVUiIKNa1V/1461.jpeg","width":1760},{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":740,"id":1017353954,"kind":2,"order":7,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/kPyfG4fPEe0kCSXWrIKNa18/1503.jpeg","width":1760},{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":740,"id":1017353957,"kind":2,"order":9,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_D/nCXhmtHPUB854tVbPIKNa2k/ba92.jpeg","width"